[[0,1010386,0,166,4,162,"2016-04-28T17:40:03","ComedicGoat","",[],"","Bad times friend ahead","https://veuwer.com/i/3t5m.jpg","4chan"],[1,5057990,0,41,0,41,"2016-04-28T19:00:33","pauly_pants","",[],"<p>How sad. Sometimes I forget how nice things are in America compared to the rest of the world.</p>"],[2,5058310,5057990,36,3,33,"2016-04-28T19:37:11","Stinkieroldgoat","",[],"<p>Wait a few more years</p>"],[3,5058499,5058310,19,1,18,"2016-04-28T19:57:11","PIcasso54","",[],"<p><sub>Hillary will watch us burn</sub></p>"],[4,5064729,5058499,1,0,1,"2016-04-29T14:15:35","ObviouslyAHuman","",[],"<p>&quot;Opposing faction member will end everything&quot; </p>\n<p>Divide. conquer.</p>"],[2,5059577,5057990,12,0,12,"2016-04-28T22:05:09","Cid","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u04yPWweZO4\">Darkmatter just made a video that really hits a similar note about taking the lives we have for granted.</a></p>"],[3,5059989,5059577,2,0,2,"2016-04-28T22:53:08","pauly_pants","",[],"<p>Thanks for sharing this.</p>"],[2,5060052,5057990,4,0,4,"2016-04-28T23:00:43","GenellanBound","",[],"<p>I feel like my generation doesn't realize that civilization and society and all the nice peaceful lives we live are not guaranteed.</p>\n<p>It could all burn to the ground. </p>"],[1,5058675,0,16,0,16,"2016-04-28T20:18:58","OcculusResurrectio","",[],"<p>That gave me chills. What a great relationship those had. Video games are amazing. </p>"],[2,5058712,5058675,11,0,11,"2016-04-28T20:23:00","revofire","",[],"<p>But it still bugs me, what happened to him? And... no one will help him. :/ I know you expected me to say no one CAN help him but that's a lie, I don't like to lie often. Everyone can help anyone, it just takes immense amounts of work, willpower, dedication, etc. I don't know. This thing wrecks me because friendship is really amazing, and it's so easy to lose that person you love and care about.</p>"],[3,5058952,5058712,2,0,2,"2016-04-28T20:48:16","OcculusResurrectio","",[],"<p>Thats a good reminder to really appreciate the relationships you have. </p>"],[4,5059087,5058952,3,0,3,"2016-04-28T21:05:32","revofire","",[],"<p>Indeed, and protect those you love.</p>"],[3,5059772,5058712,4,0,4,"2016-04-28T22:25:09","TiagoTiago","",[],"<p>Maybe he just forgot his password?</p>"],[4,5060574,5059772,0,0,0,"2016-04-29T00:11:18","revofire","",[],"<p>A little too hopeful aren't you?</p>"],[5,5061344,5060574,1,0,1,"2016-04-29T02:02:10","TiagoTiago","",[],"<p>Since we don't know either way, and possibly even cannot ever find out, it is important to not focus just on the worse possibilities.</p>\n<p>I'm not saying he's &quot;happy living in a farm&quot;; just that we don't know if he really is harmed in any way.</p>"],[6,5061554,5061344,2,0,2,"2016-04-29T02:29:48","revofire","",[],"<p>Yeah probably. Steam may not be his top priority, let alone games in general. Thanks for the glimmer of hope, it does make sense. :D</p>"],[1,5058755,0,7,0,7,"2016-04-28T20:26:58","TH3_1D10T","",[],"<p>War is hell, man.</p>"],[2,5058955,5058755,19,0,19,"2016-04-28T20:49:10","Son_Of_Hate","",[],"<p>No. War is war and Hell is Hell. Of the two, war is worse. There aren't any innocent people in Hell.</p>"],[3,5059178,5058955,7,0,7,"2016-04-28T21:17:33","barset","",[],"<p>~Hawkeye</p>"],[1,5059791,0,2,0,2,"2016-04-28T22:27:41","Prepackaged","",[],"<p>Going over the top armed with an RPG and wearing Nikes.</p>"],[1,5060193,0,1,0,1,"2016-04-28T23:20:13","Sinful_Casshern","",[],"<p>Already knew from the title what this was, fucking feels. Everytime.</p>"],[1,5060780,0,0,0,0,"2016-04-29T00:45:25","Alybad","",[],"<p>I remember seeing an almost identical one, but with tf2 and the guy had some sort of sickness. </p>"],[1,5061024,0,0,0,0,"2016-04-29T01:19:13","draaaak","",[],"<p>Well that's a buzz kill..</p>"],[1,5069270,0,0,0,0,"2016-04-29T23:39:15","alien_01","",[],"<p>That is beautiful. </p>"]]
